    "text": "Hemoglobin contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of iron by mass. The number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> atoms in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of hemoglobin is (Given : Atomic mass of Fe is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>56</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></math> in<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>022</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
