  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Mass of haemoglobin =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>Mass of iron atoms =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01122</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>56</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>of iron contains = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;mole of iron or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>023</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></math> atoms</p><p>Number of moles of atoms=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Mass</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>atomic</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mass</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Number of moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01122</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;of iron is</p><p>Number of moles =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01122</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>56</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00020</mn></math>&nbsp;moles</p><p>Number of atoms =Number of moles&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo></math>avogadro number</p><p>No. of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> atoms</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00020</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>022</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"